              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Problematic C function detected (strlen): If a string is missing a null terminator, strlen will read past the end of the buffer"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "enabled": true,
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS140021.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "In instances where you know the maximum size of a string's buffer, use strlen_s or strnlen to prevent over-reading",
